# What this app keeps beside the project.
#
# The run configurations belong to everybody working on it, so they are
# committed. Everything else is one machine's state — which files were
# open, where the caret was — and is not.
*
!.gitignore
!run/
!run/**

# tools.json is committed here for the same reason it is in `plantuml`: where
# this project's key is, is the project's business and not one machine's. The
# app writes this file without that line — add it, or the thing everybody is
# meant to share stays untracked.
!tools.json
